<title>MOROCCO: UAE president arrives in Morocco from U.S..</title>
<headline>UAE president arrives in Morocco from U.S..</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Arab Emirates President Sheikh Zaid bin Soltan al-Nahayan arrived in Morocco on Friday from the United States where he underwent a medical checkup, an official source said.</p>
<p>He was greeted at Rabat airport by Crown Prince Sidi Mohammed, the source said.</p>
<p>Sheikh Zaid had left Rabat for Washington on September 23. A close friend of King Hassan, the UAE leader is expected to spend a few days in Morocco on a private visit.</p>
</text>
